  "description": "The meme relies on the real-world stereotype that Islam is inherently violent, oppressive, or incompatible with modern society. This stereotype is used to justify the call for unity against 'islam', which is a direct attack on Muslims based on their religion. The phrase 'against islam!' is a clear invocation of this harmful stereotype.",
